<title>USA: Financial Bancorp names Russo chairman.</title>
<headline>Financial Bancorp names Russo chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONG ISLAND CITY, N.Y. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Bankcorp said on Thursday it named Peter Russo chairman, replacing Dominick Segrete.</p>
<p>Segrete, who remains a director, stepped down as chairman to devote more time to his architecture and design business.</p>
<p>Russo had been Financial's vice chairman.</p>
<p>Financial is the parent company of Financial Federal Savings Bank.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
